      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    }
  ],
  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "All retrieved evidence molecules show direct or functional CNS entry after systemic administration in rodents or monkeys, including brain detection, brain concentrations, PET uptake, and plasma-brain equilibrium; no record demonstrates failure of CNS access.",
